# Everything the build does not need. Keeping this tight is not just about
# image size — a fat build context is uploaded to the daemon on every build,
# and node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
assets
docs
infrastructure

# Never ship secrets into a build context (CLAUDE.md §12).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key

Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
README.md
**/README.md
CLAUDE.md
ROADMAP.md
ASSETS.md
index.html
